scn 1
# The legion-lanes2 `wall` case: a U-turn round the top of a long wall (x 98-101,
# z 48 to the bottom edge) on a 200x140 map, as the pinwheel `uturn` case but
# the block starts at x 44 and is centred on z 104. Everything the lanes2 study
# measured on it is here: wall_touch_near_permille is its 'touch' (moving,
# ordered samples within 10 cells of the wall whose footprint touches it) and
# gate.top.files_x100 its 'abreast' (the strip over the wall's end).
# Its crossing count (lane order over lines at z = 60 either side of the wall)
# has no gate in the .scn grammar: gate.top.crossings is the runner's pw.py
# flip count over the strip and is NOT comparable (report-only).
# Speed 1.79999 builds the raw 117964 speed (1.8 rounds to 117965).
# One block of 200 (10 per row, z 74-131) sent as FOUR selections of 50 on ticks 1-4
# (the source's `groups` split of one click).
# Source (lanes2 base): abreast 4.97, crossings 1223/6821, touch 11.7%, stopped
# 16.5%, stop-go 2236, back 356, reversals 87, t50 2382, t90 3162, 199 of 200
# arrived (done never).
name wall-4x50
ticks 12000
seed 7
map flat 200 140
wall 98 48 4 92
type m mover 2 2500 10 1.79999
group A 0 m 50 rect 44 74 74 89 pitch=3
group B 0 m 50 rect 44 89 74 104 pitch=3
group C 0 m 50 rect 44 104 74 119 pitch=3
group D 0 m 50 rect 44 119 74 134 pitch=3
gate top 101 0 101 47
line east 104 0 104 140
at 1 move A 150 110
at 2 move B 150 110
at 3 move C 150 110
at 4 move D 150 110
